  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">In 2023, UNRWA will continue to ensure that daily solid waste operations and environmental health services are sustained in Palestine refugee camps. The Agency will ensure the daily collection, transportation and disposal of refuse from the camps to governmental dumping sites. All sanitation labourers will be provided with PPE and additional personnel will be hired to avoid any disruption in services.</narrative>
